msgstr "Omogućeno"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Empty ifHighSpeed Default"
msgstr "Podrazumijevana vrijednost za prazan ifHighSpeed"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "When calculating Expression Thresholds, if the ifHighSpeed and ifSpeed come back as zero, use the following ifHighSpeed setting instead.  Default ifHighSpeed will be 10000 for 10GE interfaces."
msgstr "Prilikom izračunavanja pragova izraza, ako se ifHighSpeed i ifSpeed vrate kao nula, umjesto toga koristi sljedeću postavku za ifHighSpeed. Podrazumijevani ifHighSpeed bit će 10000 za 10GE interfejse."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Notification Preferences"
msgstr "Postavke obavještenja"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Disable Legacy Notifications"
msgstr "Onemogući zastarjela obavještenja"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will disable Legacy Alerting on all Thresholds.  Legacy Alerting is defined as any Specific Email Alerts not associated with a Notification List."
msgstr "Označavanjem ovog polja onemogućit ćete zastarjelo alarmiranje na svim pragovima. Zastarjelo alarmiranje se definiše kao svako specifično e-mail upozorenje koje nije povezano s listom obavještenja."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Threshold Notification Templated"
msgstr "Šablonska obavještenja praga"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If checked, when creating at Threshold Template, its Notification Settings will, by default be owned by the Threshold Template."
msgstr "Ako je označeno, prilikom kreiranja šablona praga, njegove postavke obavještenja će podrazumijevano biti u vlasništvu šablona praga."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Command Execution"
msgstr "Omogući izvršavanje komandi"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will enable the ability to run commands on Threshold breach and restoral events."
msgstr "Označavanjem ovog polja omogućit ćete pokretanje naredbi prilikom događaja prekoračenja i oporavka praga."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Per Thold Notification"
msgstr "Omogući obavještenje za pojedinačni Thold"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will enable the ability to maintain custom Email bodies for Thresholds."
msgstr "Označavanjem ovog polja omogućit ćete održavanje prilagođenih tijela e-mail poruka za pragove."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Notification Queue"
msgstr "Omogući red čekanja obavještenja"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will switch Thold from performing inline Notification to using either the Notification Daemon, or notifications performed out of band by the Notification poller."
msgstr "Označavanjem ovog polja prebacit ćete Thold sa izvršavanja obavještenja u okviru istog procesa na korištenje daemona za obavještenja ili obavještenja koja van opsega izvršava anketar obavještenja."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Sending Alert Emails to Warning Notification Lists"
msgstr "Omogući slanje e-mailova alarma listama obavještenja za upozorenja"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Check this box if you wish Warning Notification List recipients to receive Alert Emails in addition to the Alert Notification list receivers.  This case is applicable when Warning Notifications goes to Administrators and Alert Notifications go to Management."
msgstr "Označite ovo polje ako želite da primaoci sa liste obavještenja za upozorenja primaju e-mailove alarma pored primalaca sa liste obavještenja za alarme. Ovaj slučaj je primjenjiv kada obavještenja za upozorenja idu administratorima, a obavještenja za alarme rukovodstvu."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Threshold Daemon"
msgstr "Daemon za pragove"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Threshold Daemon"
msgstr "Omogući daemon za pragove"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will enable the use of a dedicated Threshold daemon. This can be used to increase system performance and/or to distribute Threshold monitoring to a separate server."
msgstr "Označavanjem ovog polja omogućit ćete korištenje namjenskog daemona za pragove. Ovo se može koristiti za povećanje performansi sistema i/ili za raspodjelu praćenja pragova na zaseban server."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Force Threshold Daemon Debug"
msgstr "Forsiraj otklanjanje grešaka daemona za pragove"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Checking this box will enable Threshold Daemon debug when operating from SystemD or through the command line.  This change is dynamic and will take effect as soon as the next Threshold loop commences."
msgstr "Označavanjem ovog polja omogućit ćete otklanjanje grešaka daemona za pragove prilikom rada iz SystemD okruženja ili putem komandne linije. Ova promjena je dinamična i stupit će na snagu čim započne sljedeća petlja pragova."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Daemon Down Notification Frequency"
msgstr "Učestalost obavještenja o padu daemona"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If the Thold Daemon is found to be down, send out an Email notification at this frequency."
msgstr "Ako se utvrdi da je Thold daemon pao, pošalji e-mail obavještenje s ovom učestalošću."

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "Every %d Hour"
msgstr "Svakih %d sati"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Daemon Threads"
msgstr "Niti daemona"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "The number of daemon threads to be handled by the Threshold Daemon."
msgstr "Broj niti daemona kojima će upravljati daemon za pragove."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "1 Process"
msgstr "1 proces"

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Processes"
msgstr "%d procesa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Logging"
msgstr "Evidentiranje"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Log Threshold Breaches"
msgstr "Bilježi prekoračenja pragova u zapisnik"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable logging of all Threshold failures to the Cacti Log."
msgstr "Omogući bilježenje svih neuspjeha pragova u Cacti zapisnik."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Show Data Source in Log"
msgstr "Prikaži izvor podataka u zapisniku"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Show the Data Source name in the Log if not present."
msgstr "Prikaži naziv izvora podataka u zapisniku ako nije prisutan."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Log Threshold Changes"
msgstr "Bilježi promjene pragova u zapisnik"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable logging of all Threshold changes to the Cacti Log."
msgstr "Omogući bilježenje svih promjena pragova u Cacti zapisnik."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Debug Log"
msgstr "Zapisnik otklanjanja grešaka"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable logging of debug messages with Threshold"
msgstr "Omogući bilježenje poruka za otklanjanje grešaka uz prag"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Alert Log Retention"
msgstr "Zadržavanje zapisnika alarma"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Keep Threshold Logs for this number of days."
msgstr "Čuvaj zapisnike pragova ovoliko dana."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Log action Consider Unknown Data as Zero"
msgstr "Zabilježi radnju Smatraj nepoznate podatke nulom"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "When 'Consider Unknown Data as Zero' is enabled, log when it occurs"
msgstr "Kada je omogućeno 'Smatraj nepoznate podatke nulom', zabilježi kada se to dogodi"

#: includes/settings.php thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "Syslog Settings"
msgstr "Syslog postavke"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Syslog Enabled"
msgstr "Syslog omogućen"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If checked, when creating a new Threshold, by default new Threshold events will be sent to your local syslog.  This setting is a preset.  Threshold settings dictate actual syslog control."
msgstr "Ako je označeno, prilikom kreiranja novog praga, novi događaji praga će se podrazumijevano slati u vaš lokalni syslog. Ova postavka je unaprijed definisana vrijednost. Postavke praga određuju stvarnu syslog kontrolu."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default Priority/Level"
msgstr "Podrazumijevani prioritet/nivo"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the default Priority/Level that Thold will use to send syslog messages.  This setting is a preset.  Threshold settings dictate actual syslog control."
msgstr "Ovo je podrazumijevani prioritet/nivo koji će Thold koristiti za slanje syslog poruka. Ova postavka je unaprijed definisana vrijednost. Postavke praga određuju stvarnu syslog kontrolu."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default Facility"
msgstr "Podrazumijevana kategorija"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the default Facility that Thold will use to send syslog messages.  This setting is a preset.  Threshold settings dictate actual syslog control."
msgstr "Ovo je podrazumijevana kategorija koju će Thold koristiti za slanje syslog poruka. Ova postavka je unaprijed definisana vrijednost. Postavke praga određuju stvarnu syslog kontrolu."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Alert Presets"
msgstr "Unaprijed definisane postavke alarma"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Weekend exemptions"
msgstr "Izuzeci za vikend"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this is checked, Thold will not run on weekends."
msgstr "Ako je ovo označeno, Thold se neće pokretati vikendom."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default Trigger Count"
msgstr "Podrazumijevani broj okidanja"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default number of consecutive times the Data Source must be in breach of the Threshold for an Alert to be raised."
msgstr "Podrazumijevani broj uzastopnih puta kada izvor podataka mora prekršiti prag da bi se aktivirao alarm."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Re-Alerting"
msgstr "Ponovno alarmiranje"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Repeat Alert after specified number of poller cycles."
msgstr "Ponovi alarm nakon navedenog broja ciklusa polera."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Baseline Presets"
msgstr "Unaprijed zadane postavke osnovne linije"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Baseline Time Range Default"
msgstr "Podrazumijevani vremenski raspon osnovne linije"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the default value used in creating Thresholds or templates."
msgstr "Ovo je podrazumijevana vrijednost koja se koristi pri kreiranju pragova ili šablona."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Baseline Trigger Count"
msgstr "Broj okidanja osnovne linije"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default number of consecutive times the Data Source must be in breach of the calculated Baseline Threshold for an Alert to be raised."
msgstr "Podrazumijevani broj uzastopnih puta kada izvor podataka mora prekršiti izračunati prag osnovne linije da bi se aktivirao alarm."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Baseline Deviation Percentage"
msgstr "Procenat odstupanja osnovne linije"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "SNMP Notification Options"
msgstr "Opcije SNMP obavještenja"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "SNMP Notifications"
msgstr "SNMP obavještenja"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Threshold status messages (informs/traps) will be sent to SNMP notification receivers. This includes Alerts, Warnings and Restoration traps per default. Note: This feature requires the Cacti SNMPAgent plugin."
msgstr "Poruke o statusu praga (informs/traps) bit će poslane primaocima SNMP obavještenja. Ovo podrazumijevano uključuje alarme, upozorenja i trapove za oporavak. Napomena: Ova funkcija zahtijeva dodatak Cacti SNMPAgent."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Disable Warning Notifications"
msgstr "Onemogući obavještenja za upozorenja"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this is checked, Threshold will not send a notification when a warning Threshold has been breached."
msgstr "Ako je ovo označeno, Prag neće poslati obavještenje kada se prekrši prag upozorenja."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Disable Restoration Notifications"
msgstr "Onemogući obavještenja o oporavku"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this is checked, Threshold will not send a notification when the Threshold has returned to normal status."
msgstr "Ako je ovo označeno, Prag neće poslati obavještenje kada se prag vrati u normalan status."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Emailing Options"
msgstr "Opcije e-pošte"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Send Emails with Urgent Priority"
msgstr "Šalji e-poruke sa hitnim prioritetom"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Allows you to set Emails with urgent priority"
msgstr "Omogućava vam da postavite e-poruke sa hitnim prioritetom"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Send Alerts as Text"
msgstr "Šalji alarme kao tekst"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If checked, this will cause all Alerts to be sent as plain text Emails with no graph.  The default is HTML Emails with the graph embedded in the Email."
msgstr "Ako je označeno, svi alarmi bit će poslani kao e-poruke u obliku običnog teksta bez grafikona. Podrazumijevano su to HTML e-poruke sa grafikonom ugrađenim u e-poruku."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Send Email separately for each address"
msgstr "Pošalji e-mail odvojeno za svaku adresu"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If checked, this will cause all Emails to be sent separately for each address."
msgstr "Ako je označeno, svi e-mailovi će biti poslani odvojeno za svaku adresu."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "From Email Address"
msgstr "Adresa e-pošte pošiljaoca"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the Email address that the Threshold will appear from."
msgstr "Ovo je adresa e-pošte koja će se prikazivati kao pošiljalac za prag."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "From Name"
msgstr "Ime pošiljaoca"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the actual name that the Threshold will appear from."
msgstr "Ovo je stvarno ime koje će se prikazivati kao pošiljalac za prag."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Device Notification Options"
msgstr "Opcije obavještenja za uređaj"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Notifications"
msgstr "Omogući obavještenja"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Dead/Recovering host notification"
msgstr "Omogući obavještenje o nedostupnom/oporavljenom hostu"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Single Email Notification"
msgstr "Obavještenje jednom e-porukom"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Supported for Notification Lists and the Notification Queue only.  If there are Down Device Notifications in a single processing cycle.  Send only one Email to Notification List repipients for all Devices."
msgstr "Podržano samo za liste obavještenja i red čekanja obavještenja. Ako postoji više obavještenja o nedostupnim uređajima u jednom ciklusu obrade, pošalji samo jednu e-poruku primaocima s liste obavještenja za sve uređaje."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Single Email Notification Subject"
msgstr "Naslov obavještenja jednom e-porukom"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the Email Subject to be used for all Single Email Notification Emails for both Up and Down Devices."
msgstr "Ovo je naslov e-pošte koji će se koristiti za sve e-poruke obavještenja jednom e-porukom i za dostupne i za nedostupne uređaje."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Device Notification Delay Options"
msgstr "Opcije odgode obavještenja za uređaj"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Notification Delay"
msgstr "Odgoda obavještenja"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If a large influx of Down Device Notifications come in, Cacti can pause sending out those Notifications for a certain period of time to see if the issue is transient before sending them out.  Select the threshold Down Device Notifications before the Pause is Triggered."
msgstr "Ako stigne veliki priliv obavještenja o nedostupnim uređajima, Cacti može pauzirati slanje tih obavještenja na određeni vremenski period kako bi provjerio da li je problem privremen prije nego što ih pošalje. Odaberite prag obavještenja o nedostupnim uređajima prije aktiviranja pauze."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If you choose to delay Notifications for a large Down Devices Notification inrush, how long are you willing to wait before allowing the notifications to be processed?"
msgstr "Ako odlučite odgoditi obavještenja kod velikog priliva obavještenja o nedostupnim uređajima, koliko dugo ste spremni čekati prije nego što dozvolite obradu obavještenja?"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Device Notification Email Options"
msgstr "Opcije e-pošte obavještenja za uređaj"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Global Notification Email"
msgstr "Globalna e-pošta za obavještenja"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the Email Address that the Dead Device Notifications will be sent to if the Global Notification List is selected."
msgstr "Ovo je adresa e-pošte na koju će se slati obavještenja o nedostupnim uređajima ako je odabrana Globalna lista obavještenja."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Down Subject"
msgstr "Naslov za nedostupnost"

