#: thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "Event Triggering (Shell Command)"
msgstr "Okidanje događaja (naredba ljuske)"

#: thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "High Trigger Command"
msgstr "Naredba okidača za visoki prag"

#: thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "If set, and if a High Threshold is breached, this command will be run.  Please enter a valid command.  In addition, there are several replacement tags available that can be used to pass information from the Threshold to the script.  You can do this as arguments on the command line, or preferably, in the environment of the script.  All replacement values will appear in the environment of the script prefixed with THOLD_.  So, for example CURRENTVALUE will become THOLD_CURRENTVALUE, and so on.  The variables include: &#060DESCRIPTION&#062 &#060HOSTNAME&#062 &#060TIME&#062 &#060DATE&#062 &#060URL&#062 &#060GRAPHID&#062 &#060CURRENTVALUE&#062 &#060THRESHOLDNAME&#062 &#060DSNAME&#062 &#060SUBJECT&#062 &#060GRAPH&#062 &#060HI&#062 &#060LOW&#062 &#060DURATION&#062 &#060TRIGGER&#062 &#060DETAILS_URL&#062 &#060DATE_RFC822&#062 &#060BREACHED_ITEMS&#062.  Finally, Host, Data Query and Data Input replacement can be made.  For example, if you have a data input custom data called pending, to perform the replacement use |pending|.  For Data Query, and Host replacement use Cacti conventions |query_xxxx|, and |host_xxxx| respectively."
msgstr "Ako je postavljeno i ako je visoki prag prekoračen, ova naredba će biti pokrenuta. Unesite važeću naredbu. Pored toga, dostupno je nekoliko zamjenskih oznaka koje se mogu koristiti za prosljeđivanje informacija s praga u skriptu. To možete učiniti kao argumente na komandnoj liniji ili, po mogućnosti, u okruženju skripte. Sve zamjenske vrijednosti će se pojaviti u okruženju skripte s prefiksom THOLD_. Tako će, na primjer, CURRENTVALUE postati THOLD_CURRENTVALUE i tako dalje. Varijable uključuju: &#060DESCRIPTION&#062 &#060HOSTNAME&#062 &#060TIME&#062 &#060DATE&#062 &#060URL&#062 &#060GRAPHID&#062 &#060CURRENTVALUE&#062 &#060THRESHOLDNAME&#062 &#060DSNAME&#062 &#060SUBJECT&#062 &#060GRAPH&#062 &#060HI&#062 &#060LOW&#062 &#060DURATION&#062 &#060TRIGGER&#062 &#060DETAILS_URL&#062 &#060DATE_RFC822&#062 &#060BREACHED_ITEMS&#062. Konačno, mogu se izvršiti zamjene za host, upit podataka i unos podataka. Na primjer, ako imate prilagođeni podatak unosa podataka pod nazivom pending, za zamjenu koristite |pending|. Za zamjenu upita podataka i hosta koristite Cacti konvencije |query_xxxx| i |host_xxxx| respektivno."

#: thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "Low Trigger Command"
msgstr "Naredba okidača za niski prag"

#: thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "If set, and if a Low Threshold is breached, this command will be run. Please enter a valid command.  In addition, there are several replacement tags available that can be used to pass information from the Threshold to the script.  You can do this as arguments on the command line, or preferably, in the environment of the script.  All replacement values will appear in the environment of the script prefixed with THOLD_.  So, for example CURRENTVALUE will become THOLD_CURRENTVALUE, and so on.  The variables include: &#060DESCRIPTION&#062 &#060HOSTNAME&#062 &#060TIME&#062 &#060DATE&#062 &#060URL&#062 &#060GRAPHID&#062 &#060CURRENTVALUE&#062 &#060THRESHOLDNAME&#062 &#060DSNAME&#062 &#060SUBJECT&#062 &#060GRAPH&#062 &#060HI&#062 &#060LOW&#062 &#060DURATION&#062 &#060TRIGGER&#062 &#060DETAILS_URL&#062 &#060DATE_RFC822&#062 &#060BREACHED_ITEMS&#062.  Finally, Host, Data Query and Data input replacement can be made.  For example, if you have a data input custom data called pending, to perform the replacement use |pending|.  For Data Query, and Host replacement use Cacti conventions |query_xxxx|, and |host_xxxx| respectively."
msgstr "Ako je postavljeno i ako je donji prag prekršen, ova komanda će se pokrenuti. Molimo unesite važeću komandu. Pored toga, dostupno je nekoliko oznaka za zamjenu koje se mogu koristiti za prosljeđivanje informacija od praga do skripte. To možete učiniti kao argumente u komandnoj liniji ili, po mogućnosti, u okruženju skripte. Sve zamjenske vrijednosti će se pojaviti u okruženju skripte s prefiksom THOLD_. Tako će, na primjer, CURRENTVALUE postati THOLD_CURRENTVALUE i tako dalje. Varijable uključuju: &#060DESCRIPTION&#062 &#060HOSTNAME&#062 &#060TIME&#062 &#060DATE&#062 &#060URL&#062 &#060GRAPHID&#062 &#060CURRENTVALUE&#062 &#060THRESHOLDNAME&#062 &#060DSNAME&#062 &#060SUBJECT&#062 &#060GRAPH&#062 &#060HI&#062 &#060LOW&#062 &#060DURATION&#062 &#060TRIGGER&#062 &#060DETAILS_URL&#062 &#060DATE_RFC822&#062 &#060BREACHED_ITEMS&#062. Konačno, mogu se izvršiti zamjene za host, upit za podatke i unos podataka. Na primjer, ako imate prilagođeni podatak unosa podataka pod nazivom pending, za izvršavanje zamjene koristite |pending|. Za zamjenu upita za podatke i hosta koristite Cacti konvencije |query_xxxx|, odnosno |host_xxxx|."

#: thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "Norm Trigger Command"
msgstr "Komanda okidača za normalno stanje"

#: thold.php thold_templates.php
msgid "If set, when a thold falls back to a normal value, this command will be run.  Please enter a valid command.  In addition, there are several replacement tags available that can be used to pass information from the Threshold to the script.  You can do this as arguments on the command line, or preferably, in the environment of the script.  All replacement values will appear in the environment of the script prefixed with THOLD_.  So, for example CURRENTVALUE will become THOLD_CURRENTVALUE, and so on.  The variables include: &#060DESCRIPTION&#062 &#060HOSTNAME&#062 &#060TIME&#062 &#060DATE&#062 &#060URL&#062 &#060GRAPHID&#062 &#060CURRENTVALUE&#062 &#060THRESHOLDNAME&#062 &#060DSNAME&#062 &#060SUBJECT&#062 &#060GRAPH&#062 &#060HI&#062 &#060LOW&#062 &#060DURATION&#062 &#060TRIGGER&#062 &#060DETAILS_URL&#062 &#060DATE_RFC822&#062 &#060BREACHED_ITEMS&#062.  Finally, Host, Data Query and Data input replacement can be made.  For example, if you have a data input custom data called pending, to perform the replacement use |pending|.  For Data Query, and Host replacement use Cacti conventions |query_xxxx|, and |host_xxxx| respectively."
msgstr "Ako je postavljeno, kada se prag vrati na normalnu vrijednost, ova komanda će se pokrenuti. Molimo unesite važeću komandu. Pored toga, dostupno je nekoliko oznaka za zamjenu koje se mogu koristiti za prosljeđivanje informacija od praga do skripte. To možete učiniti kao argumente u komandnoj liniji ili, po mogućnosti, u okruženju skripte. Sve zamjenske vrijednosti će se pojaviti u okruženju skripte s prefiksom THOLD_. Tako će, na primjer, CURRENTVALUE postati THOLD_CURRENTVALUE i tako dalje. Varijable uključuju: &#060DESCRIPTION&#062 &#060HOSTNAME&#062 &#060TIME&#062 &#060DATE&#062 &#060URL&#062 &#060GRAPHID&#062 &#060CURRENTVALUE&#062 &#060THRESHOLDNAME&#062 &#060DSNAME&#062 &#060SUBJECT&#062 &#060GRAPH&#062 &#060HI&#062 &#060LOW&#062 &#060DURATION&#062 &#060TRIGGER&#062 &#060DETAILS_URL&#062 &#060DATE_RFC822&#062 &#060BREACHED_ITEMS&#062. Konačno, mogu se izvršiti zamjene za host, upit za podatke i unos podataka. Na primjer, ako imate prilagođeni podatak unosa podataka pod nazivom pending, za izvršavanje zamjene koristite |pending|. Za zamjenu upita za podatke i hosta koristite Cacti konvencije |query_xxxx|, odnosno |host_xxxx|."

