#: thold_templates.php
#, php-format
msgid "An RPN Expression is an RRDtool Compatible RPN Expression.  Syntax includes all functions below in addition to both Device and Data Query replacement expressions such as <span style=\"color:blue;\">|query_ifSpeed|</span>.  To use a Data Source in the RPN Expression, you must use the syntax: <span style=\"color:blue;\">|ds:dsname|</span>.  For example, <span style=\"color:blue;\">|ds:traffic_in|</span> will get the current value of the traffic_in Data Source for the RRDfile(s) associated with the Graph. Any Data Source for a Graph can be included.<br>Math Operators: <span style=\"color:blue;\">+, -, /, *, &#37;, ^</span><br>Functions: <span style=\"color:blue;\">SIN, COS, TAN, ATAN, SQRT, FLOOR, CEIL, DEG2RAD, RAD2DEG, ABS, EXP, LOG, ATAN, ADNAN</span><br>Flow Operators: <span style=\"color:blue;\">UN, ISINF, IF, LT, LE, GT, GE, EQ, NE</span><br>Comparison Functions: <span style=\"color:blue;\">MAX, MIN, INF, NEGINF, NAN, UNKN, COUNT, PREV</span>%s %s"
msgstr "RPN izraz je RPN izraz kompatibilan sa alatom RRDtool. Sintaksa uključuje sve funkcije u nastavku, pored izraza za zamjenu za uređaj i upit podataka kao što je <span style=\"color:blue;\">|query_ifSpeed|</span>. Da biste koristili izvor podataka u RPN izrazu, morate koristiti sintaksu: <span style=\"color:blue;\">|ds:dsname|</span>. Na primjer, <span style=\"color:blue;\">|ds:traffic_in|</span> će dohvatiti trenutnu vrijednost izvora podataka traffic_in za RRD datoteku/datoteke povezane sa grafikonom. Može se uključiti bilo koji izvor podataka za grafikon.<br>Matematički operatori: <span style=\"color:blue;\">+, -, /, *, &#37;, ^</span><br>Funkcije: <span style=\"color:blue;\">SIN, COS, TAN, ATAN, SQRT, FLOOR, CEIL, DEG2RAD, RAD2DEG, ABS, EXP, LOG, ATAN, ADNAN</span><br>Operatori toka: <span style=\"color:blue;\">UN, ISINF, IF, LT, LE, GT, GE, EQ, NE</span><br>Funkcije poređenja: <span style=\"color:blue;\">MAX, MIN, INF, NEGINF, NAN, UNKN, COUNT, PREV</span>%s %s"

